TextFlow
Research code for "Towards Training-Free Scene Text Editing".

Original TextFlow contributions are distributed under the Apache License 2.0.

This distribution contains code adapted from Hugging Face diffusers
(https://github.com/huggingface/diffusers), including FLUX-Kontext and
LongCat-related model and pipeline implementations. Existing upstream
copyright and license notices are retained in the source files. The
diffusers license is also included in third_party/diffusers/LICENSE.

TextFlow modifications include scene text editing, Flow Manifold Steering,
attention-modulated overshoot sampling, and inference safety fixes.
Modified backend files carry a notice identifying these adaptations.

Model weights and datasets are not distributed with this release and
remain subject to their respective licenses and access conditions.
